  "spellcastingEntries": [
    {
      "name": "Primal Spontaneous Spells",
      "type": "spontaneous",
      "bonus": 12,
      "dc": 22,
      "focusPoints": {
        "current": 0,
        "max": 0
      },
      "autoHeightenLevel": 2,
      "cantrips": [
        {
          "name": "Dancing Lights",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "light",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "120 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You create up to four floating lights, no two of which are more than 10 feet apart. Each sheds light like a torch. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move any number of lights up to 60 feet. Each light must remain within 120 feet of you and within 10 feet of all others, or it winks out.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "rUjlQNfsOxhS6mnj"
        },
        {
          "name": "Produce Flame",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "concentrate",
            "fire",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>A small ball of flame appears in the palm of your hand, and you lash out with it either in melee or at range. Make a spell attack roll against your target's AC. This is normally a ranged attack, but you can also make a melee attack against a creature in your unarmed reach.</p>\n<p>On a success, you deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d4</span> fire damage. On a critical success, the target takes double damage and <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> persistent plus fire damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> Increase the damage by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> and the persistent damage on a critical hit by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "7nxzOzY80NYE1AkL"
        },
        {
          "name": "Read Aura",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "detection",
            "manipulate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "1 minute",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 object",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical, and if it is, you learn the school of magic.</p>\n<p>If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's level is lower than the rank of your read aura spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "z2zZOMBYqex7ReF8"
        },
        {
          "name": "Tanglefoot",
          "type": "cantrip",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "attack",
            "concentrate",
            "manipulate",
            "plant"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>A vine covered in sticky sap appears from thin air, flicking from your hand and lashing itself to the target. Attempt a spell attack against the target.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target gains the Immobilized condition and takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty and the Immobilized condition.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds for 1 round. It can attempt to Escape against your spell DC to remove the penalty.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The effects last for 2 rounds.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The effects last for 1 minute.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "O8pRkYJSFJXW5zS0"
        }
      ],
      "rituals": [],
      "spellLocations": [],
      "usedAttribute": "charisma",
      "_id": "7STN0PrV0AblMmmM",
      "modifications": [],
      "lv1spells": [
        {
          "name": "Burning Hands",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "fire"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "",
          "range": "",
          "area": "15 ft cone",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "basic reflex",
          "description": "<p>Gouts of flame rush from your hands. You deal <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> fire damage to creatures in the area.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "p2ZktRIBHgFBAdTH"
        },
        {
          "name": "Longstrider",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "1 hour",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>You lengthen your stride beyond what should be possible. You gain a +10-foot status bonus to your Speed.</p>\n\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The duration increases to 8 hours.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "Ik2hDskEneoQxMhT"
        },
        {
          "name": "Ventriloquism",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 1,
          "traits": [
            "auditory",
            "concentrate",
            "illusion"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Whenever you speak or make any other sound vocally, you can make your vocalization seem to originate from somewhere else within 60 feet, and you can change that apparent location freely as you vocalize. Any creature that hears the sound can attempt to disbelieve your illusion.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (2nd)</strong> The spell's duration increases to 1 hour, and you can also change the tone, quality, and other aspects of your voice. Before a creature can attempt to disbelieve your illusion, it must actively attempt a Perception check or otherwise use actions to interact with the sound.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "XFwbLH1IB9lL446c"
        }
      ],
      "lv1slots": {
        "current": 3,
        "max": 3
      },
      "lv2spells": [
        {
          "name": "Flaming Sphere",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate",
            "fire"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "1 minute",
          "range": "30 feet",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "",
          "save": "reflex",
          "description": "<p>You create a sphere of flame in a square within range. The sphere must be supported by a solid surface, such as a stone floor. The sphere deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> fire damage to each creature in the square where it first appears; each creature must attempt a basic Reflex save. On subsequent rounds, the first time you Sustain this Spell, you can leave the sphere in its square or roll it to another square within range. It deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">3d6</span> fire damage (basic Reflex save) to each creature in that square.</p>\n<p>Creatures that succeed at their save take no damage (instead of half).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d6</span>.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "58nGgeaHKBQYWO3i"
        },
        {
          "name": "Resist Energy",
          "type": "spell",
          "level": 2,
          "traits": [
            "concentrate"
          ],
          "castingTime": "2",
          "duration": "10 minutes",
          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>A shield of elemental energy protects a creature against one type of energy damage. Choose acid, cold, electricity, fire, or sonic damage. The target and its gear gain resistance 5 against the damage type you chose.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The resistance increases to 10, and you can target up to two creatures.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (7th)</strong> The resistance increases to 15, and you can target up to five creatures.</p>",
          "cast": false,
          "cost": "",
          "primaryCheck": "",
          "secondaryCasters": "",
          "secondaryChecks": "",
          "id": "ZJj0Nw3JLu47zWgG"
        }
      ],
